{
  "name": "Turn Google Shopping product trends into OpenAI merchandising briefs in Sheets, Gmail, and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Shopping Trends Scraper: Product Demand — AI Co-Pilot & Multi-App Pipeline\n\nExtracts fresh data on a schedule with the **[google-shopping-trends-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-shopping-trends-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.00045 / item), skips seen records, logs all rows to **Google Sheets** and **CSV**, and enriches top matches with **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for **Slack** and **Gmail**.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every 6 Hours** loads rules from **1. Configure Search & Rules**.\n2. **2. Run UnitBytes (google-shopping-trends-scraper)** fetches data and **3. Skip Seen Records** deduplicates by `keyword`.\n3. **4. Clean & Score Items** and **5. Map Export Fields** normalize `keyword, date, value, geo` and compute `priorityScore`.\n4. **6a. Log to Google Sheets** and **6b. Export Backup CSV** save all rows, while **6c. Filter High-Priority Items** routes top matches to **7. AI SEO & Content Brief Strategist**.\n5. **8. Merge AI Content Strategy Brief** merges AI fields and triggers **9a. Send Breakout Trend Brief to Slack** and **9b. Draft Editorial Brief in Gmail**.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your token from [google-shopping-trends-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-shopping-trends-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) to the **HTTP Header Auth** credential on node 2 (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`).\n2. Edit `actorInput`, `sheetTab`, and `minTrendValue` in node 1.\n3. Connect **OpenAI**, **Google Sheets**, **Slack**, and **Gmail** credentials.\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust `minTrendValue` in node 1 or the prompt in node 7.\n- Docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-shopping-trends-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-shopping-trends-scraper/)",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "c4b2f438-a837-52e6-ae06-36afa417ce61",
      "name": "Overview",
